;; typing/typeclass.ml (class_structure's two passes, type_object, class declarations and their class expressions)
;; with the class signatures' operations of typing/ctype.ml (new_class_signature, filter_method_row, add_method,
;; add_instance_variable, update_class_signature, close_class_signature, hide_private_methods) and Typecore's
;; object expressions (type_send, filter_method), whose notices follow (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
;;  Jerome Vouillon, projet Cristal, INRIA Rocquencourt
